{% comment %}
========================================================================
PROVENZANO HOME — versión completa premium (1 archivo)
========================================================================
Secciones (en orden):
  1.  Header glass dark (sticky)
  2.  Hero bodega + mapa Argentina con líneas de envío
  3.  Trust band (4 features reales)
  4.  Brand wall (Energizer · Duracell · Gillette · Candela · BIC)
  5.  Category orbit (anillo rotando con categorías)
  6.  Estantería de productos destacados (8 cards)
  7.  Por qué Provenzano (credenciales + stats)
  8.  Calculadora de bulto interactiva
  9.  How to buy (4 pasos scroll-jacked)
  10. FAQ con acordeón
  11. Newsletter para revendedores (lista de precios PDF)
  12. Footer azul oscuro
  13. WhatsApp FAB flotante

INSTALACIÓN:
1. Editar código del tema → carpeta "Sections" → Add a new section
2. Nombre: home-provenzano.liquid
3. Pegar TODO este contenido y guardar
4. Personalizador → Add section → "Home Provenzano"

REQUISITOS:
- Colección "destacados-hero" (productos del hero, opcional)
- Colección "destacados" (8 productos de la estantería)
- WhatsApp = 5491141794592 (configurable en el panel)

Mobile-first: 90% del tráfico viene de mobile. Todo testeado < 360px.
========================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home Provenzano",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "logo_url",
      "label": "URL del logo (Shopify CDN)",
      "default": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0729/9366/9368/files/provenzano-logo.svg?v=1777313813"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "wpp_phone",
      "label": "Número de WhatsApp (sin +, sin espacios)",
      "default": "5491141794592"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "hero_collection",
      "label": "Colección hero (opcional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "featured_collection",
      "label": "Colección de productos destacados (8 cards)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "calc_product_name",
      "label": "Calculadora · nombre del producto",
      "default": "Encendedor BIC Maxi"
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "calc_units_per_bulto",
      "label": "Calculadora · unidades por bulto",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "calc_price_mayorista",
      "label": "Calculadora · precio mayorista por unidad (ARS)",
      "default": 850
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "id": "calc_price_minorista",
      "label": "Calculadora · precio minorista promedio por unidad (ARS)",
      "default": 1400
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Home Provenzano" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}

{%- assign logo_url = section.settings.logo_url | default: 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0729/9366/9368/files/provenzano-logo.svg?v=1777313813' -%}
{%- assign wpp_phone = section.settings.wpp_phone | default: '5491141794592' -%}
{%- assign hero_products = section.settings.hero_collection.products | default: collections['destacados-hero'].products -%}
{%- assign featured_products = section.settings.featured_collection.products | default: collections['destacados'].products -%}
{%- assign calc_name = section.settings.calc_product_name | default: 'Encendedor BIC Maxi' -%}
{%- assign calc_units = section.settings.calc_units_per_bulto | default: 50 -%}
{%- assign calc_pmay = section.settings.calc_price_mayorista | default: 850 -%}
{%- assign calc_pmin = section.settings.calc_price_minorista | default: 1400 -%}

<div class="pv-home-root">

  {%- comment -%} ============ HEADER ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="pv-header" id="provHeader">
    <div class="pv-header__inner">
      <a href="/" class="pv-header__logo" aria-label="Provenzano home">
        <span class="pv-header__mark">
          <img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="">
        </span>
        <div class="pv-header__wordmark">
          <span class="pv-header__brand">Provenzano</span>
          <span class="pv-header__tag">
            <span class="pv-header__dot"></span>
            Mayorista · Liniers
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/search" class="pv-header__search" aria-label="Buscar">
        <i data-lucide="search"></i>
        <span>Buscar producto, categoría, marca…</span>
        <kbd class="pv-header__kbd">⌘K</kbd>
      </a>

      <a href="/cart" class="pv-header__cart" aria-label="Carrito">
        <i data-lucide="shopping-cart"></i>
        <span class="pv-header__cart-badge" id="provCartBadge" style="display:none">0</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="pv-header__beam" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </header>
  {%- comment -%} ============ HERO ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-hero" id="provHero">
    <div class="pv-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="pv-hero__grid-bg"></div>
      <div class="pv-hero__orb pv-hero__orb--a"></div>
      <div class="pv-hero__orb pv-hero__orb--b"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="pv-hero__inner">
      <div class="pv-hero__copy">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow--live">
          <span class="pv-eyebrow__dot"></span>
          Mayorista · Liniers · Desde 2003
        </span>

        <h1 class="pv-hero__title">
          Productos de kiosco <span class="pv-hero__title-accent">por mayor</span>, sin vueltas.
        </h1>

        <p class="pv-hero__lead">Abastecé tu kiosco, almacén o negocio con productos de alta rotación. Stock garantizado, envíos a todo el país y +20 años trabajando con revendedores como vos.</p>

        <div class="pv-hero__ctas">
          <a href="/collections/all" class="pv-btn pv-btn--primary pv-btn--lg">
            <i data-lucide="layout-grid"></i>
            Ver catálogo
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ wpp_phone }}?text={{ 'Hola Provenzano, quiero hacer una consulta' | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pv-btn pv-btn--whatsapp pv-btn--lg">
            <i data-lucide="message-circle"></i>
            Consultar por WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pv-hero__stats">
          <div class="pv-hero__stat">
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-value" data-counter="216" data-suffix="+">0+</span>
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-label">Productos en stock</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pv-hero__stat-div"></div>
          <div class="pv-hero__stat">
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-value" data-counter="20">0</span>
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-label">Años en el rubro</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pv-hero__stat-div"></div>
          <div class="pv-hero__stat">
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-value" data-counter="24" data-suffix="hs">0hs</span>
            <span class="pv-hero__stat-label">Despacho CABA/GBA</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="pv-hero__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="pv-hero__stage" id="provHeroStage">
          <div class="pv-map" id="provMap">
            <svg class="pv-map__svg" viewBox="0 0 400 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
              <defs>
                <radialGradient id="pv-map-glow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(147,197,253,0.5)"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(147,197,253,0)"/>
                </radialGradient>
              </defs>
              <g class="pv-map__country">
                <path d="M 220,40 L 235,55 L 240,75 L 248,95 L 256,115 L 268,140 L 274,165 L 282,195 L 290,225 L 296,255 L 298,290 L 290,325 L 280,360 L 268,395 L 252,425 L 234,450 L 215,470 L 195,485 L 178,495 L 165,505 L 158,520 L 162,533 L 175,530 L 175,512 L 188,508 L 192,495 L 178,488 L 198,470 L 215,455 L 220,470 L 215,488 L 218,500 L 232,492 L 230,478 L 240,460 L 252,440 L 230,425 L 215,395 L 200,370 L 185,345 L 170,335 L 155,330 L 148,320 L 152,300 L 168,285 L 180,272 L 186,250 L 178,225 L 168,200 L 155,180 L 148,158 L 152,135 L 162,115 L 175,95 L 188,72 L 200,55 L 210,42 Z" fill="rgba(147,197,253,0.06)" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.30)" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M 195,140 L 270,150" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <path d="M 175,210 L 285,225" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <path d="M 165,290 L 295,295" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <path d="M 175,360 L 270,365" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
                <path d="M 195,430 L 240,440" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2,3"/>
              </g>
              <g class="pv-map__lines" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none">
                <path class="pv-map__line" style="--delay:0s" d="M 260,295 Q 270,330 255,360" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path class="pv-map__line" style="--delay:0.4s" d="M 260,295 Q 240,270 230,235" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path class="pv-map__line" style="--delay:0.8s" d="M 260,295 Q 235,250 220,200" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path class="pv-map__line" style="--delay:1.2s" d="M 260,295 Q 225,265 200,230" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path class="pv-map__line" style="--delay:1.6s" d="M 260,295 Q 210,300 170,280" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </g>
              <g class="pv-map__origin" transform="translate(260,295)">
                <circle r="20" fill="url(#pv-map-glow)" opacity="0.6"/>
                <circle class="pv-map__ping" r="8" fill="none" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"/>
                <circle class="pv-map__ping" r="8" fill="none" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7" style="animation-delay:1s"/>
                <circle r="8" fill="#185FA5" stroke="#93C5FD" stroke-width="2"/>
                <circle r="3" fill="#fff"/>
              </g>
              <g class="pv-map__pin" style="--delay:1.4s" transform="translate(255,360)"><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD"/><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD" class="pv-map__pin-pulse"/></g>
              <g class="pv-map__pin" style="--delay:1.8s" transform="translate(230,235)"><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD"/><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD" class="pv-map__pin-pulse"/></g>
              <g class="pv-map__pin" style="--delay:2.2s" transform="translate(220,200)"><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD"/><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD" class="pv-map__pin-pulse"/></g>
              <g class="pv-map__pin" style="--delay:2.6s" transform="translate(200,230)"><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD"/><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD" class="pv-map__pin-pulse"/></g>
              <g class="pv-map__pin" style="--delay:3.0s" transform="translate(170,280)"><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD"/><circle r="4" fill="#93C5FD" class="pv-map__pin-pulse"/></g>
            </svg>

            <span class="pv-map__label pv-map__label--origin" style="--x:65%;--y:54.6%">
              <span class="pv-map__label-eyebrow">Origen</span>
              CABA · GBA
            </span>
            <span class="pv-map__label" style="--x:64%;--y:67%">Mar del Plata</span>
            <span class="pv-map__label" style="--x:58%;--y:43.5%">Rosario</span>
            <span class="pv-map__label" style="--x:55%;--y:37%">Santa Fe</span>
            <span class="pv-map__label pv-map__label--left" style="--x:50%;--y:42.6%">Córdoba</span>
            <span class="pv-map__label pv-map__label--left" style="--x:42.5%;--y:51.8%">Mendoza</span>
          </div>

          <div class="pv-hero__hud pv-hero__hud--tl">
            <span class="pv-hero__hud-label">Cobertura</span>
            <span class="pv-hero__hud-value">CABA · GBA · Interior</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pv-hero__hud pv-hero__hud--br">
            <div class="pv-hero__hud-row">
              <span class="pv-hero__hud-dot"></span>
              <span class="pv-hero__hud-text">CABA / GBA · Mismo día</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pv-hero__hud-row">
              <span class="pv-hero__hud-text-mono">Interior · Vía Cargo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- comment -%} ============ TRUST BAND ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-trust" aria-label="Beneficios">
    <div class="pv-trust__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="pv-trust__inner">
      <article class="pv-trust__card" style="--idx:0">
        <span class="pv-trust__icon"><i data-lucide="package-check"></i></span>
        <div class="pv-trust__copy">
          <h3 class="pv-trust__title">Stock real</h3>
          <p class="pv-trust__text">Lo que ves está en bodega. Sin sorpresas al confirmar.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pv-trust__card" style="--idx:1">
        <span class="pv-trust__icon"><i data-lucide="truck"></i></span>
        <div class="pv-trust__copy">
          <h3 class="pv-trust__title">Envío 24hs</h3>
          <p class="pv-trust__text">CABA y GBA mismo día. Interior vía cargo.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pv-trust__card" style="--idx:2">
        <span class="pv-trust__icon"><i data-lucide="handshake"></i></span>
        <div class="pv-trust__copy">
          <h3 class="pv-trust__title">Sin mínimos rígidos</h3>
          <p class="pv-trust__text">Compras desde 1 bulto. Reponé como necesites.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pv-trust__card" style="--idx:3">
        <span class="pv-trust__icon"><i data-lucide="file-check-2"></i></span>
        <div class="pv-trust__copy">
          <h3 class="pv-trust__title">Factura A</h3>
          <p class="pv-trust__text">Transferencia, depósito o efectivo en local.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- comment -%} ============ BRANDS WALL ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-brands" aria-label="Marcas que trabajamos">
    <div class="pv-brands__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="pv-brands__inner">
      <header class="pv-brands__head">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow--dark"><span class="pv-eyebrow__dot"></span>Marcas oficiales</span>
        <h2 class="pv-brands__title">Las marcas que tus clientes <span class="pv-brands__title-accent">ya conocen</span></h2>
        <p class="pv-brands__lead">Trabajamos directo con primeras marcas. Producto original, precio mayorista.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="pv-brands__marquee" aria-hidden="false">
        <ul class="pv-brands__track">
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--energizer"><span class="pv-brand__name">Energizer</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Pilas</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--duracell"><span class="pv-brand__name">Duracell</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Pilas</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--gillette"><span class="pv-brand__name">Gillette</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Afeitado</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--candela"><span class="pv-brand__name">Candela</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Hogar</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--bic"><span class="pv-brand__name">BIC</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Encendedores</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--energizer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pv-brand__name">Energizer</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Pilas</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--duracell" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pv-brand__name">Duracell</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Pilas</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--gillette" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pv-brand__name">Gillette</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Afeitado</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--candela" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pv-brand__name">Candela</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Hogar</span></li>
          <li class="pv-brand pv-brand--bic" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pv-brand__name">BIC</span><span class="pv-brand__cat">Encendedores</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- comment -%} ============ ORBIT ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-orbit">
    <div class="pv-orbit__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="pv-orbit__grid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="pv-orbit__inner">
      <header class="pv-orbit__head">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow--dark"><span class="pv-eyebrow__dot"></span>Catálogo</span>
        <h2 class="pv-orbit__title">
          Rubros que <span class="pv-orbit__title-accent">más rotan</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="pv-orbit__lead">Las categorías de mayor demanda mayorista. Tocá cualquier rubro para ver todos los productos.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="pv-orbit__stage" id="provOrbitStage">
        <svg class="pv-orbit__rings" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <radialGradient id="pv-ring-fade" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(147,197,253,0.4)"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(147,197,253,0)"/>
            </radialGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="280" fill="none" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.10)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 6"/>
          <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="220" fill="none" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.18)" stroke-width="1"/>
          <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="160" fill="none" stroke="rgba(147,197,253,0.12)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
          <circle cx="300" cy="300" r="100" fill="url(#pv-ring-fade)" opacity="0.3"/>
        </svg>

        <div class="pv-orbit__core">
          <div class="pv-orbit__core-pulse"></div>
          <div class="pv-orbit__core-ring"></div>
          <div class="pv-orbit__core-mark">
            <img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="Provenzano">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pv-orbit__ring" id="provOrbitRing">
          {% assign cats = 'encendedores|flame|Encendedores,pilas|battery|Pilas,pegamentos|paperclip|Pegamentos,afeitado|scissors|Afeitado,perfumeria|sparkles|Perfumería,repelentes|bug|Repelentes,golosinas|candy|Golosinas,farmacia|cross|Farmacia' | split: ',' %}
          {% for cat in cats %}
            {% assign parts = cat | split: '|' %}
            {% assign cat_handle = parts[0] %}
            {% assign cat_icon = parts[1] %}
            {% assign cat_name = parts[2] %}
            {% assign idx = forloop.index0 %}
            {% assign angle = idx | times: 45 %}
            <a href="/collections/{{ cat_handle }}" class="pv-orbit__pin" style="--angle:{{ angle }}deg;--idx:{{ idx }}" aria-label="{{ cat_name }}">
              <span class="pv-orbit__pin-core">
                <i data-lucide="{{ cat_icon }}"></i>
              </span>
              <span class="pv-orbit__pin-label">
                <span class="pv-orbit__pin-name">{{ cat_name }}</span>
                <span class="pv-orbit__pin-arrow"><i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></span>
              </span>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <div class="pv-orbit__hud">
          <span class="pv-orbit__hud-label">Rubro</span>
          <span class="pv-orbit__hud-value" id="provOrbitHudValue">Tocá un rubro</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- comment -%} ============ SHELF (PRODUCTOS DESTACADOS) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if featured_products.size > 0 %}
  <section class="pv-shelf" id="provShelf">
    <div class="pv-shelf__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="pv-shelf__grid"></div>
      <div class="pv-shelf__beam"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="pv-shelf__inner">
      <header class="pv-shelf__head">
        <div class="pv-shelf__head-left">
          <span class="pv-eyebrow--live"><span class="pv-eyebrow__dot"></span>Inventario · Live</span>
          <h2 class="pv-shelf__title">
            Lo que <span class="pv-shelf__title-accent">más rota</span> en bodega
          </h2>
          <p class="pv-shelf__lead">Los 8 productos que tus colegas kiosqueros y almaceneros más están moviendo esta semana. Stock real, precio mayorista.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-shelf__head-right">
          <div class="pv-shelf__counter">
            <span class="pv-shelf__counter-value">8</span>
            <span class="pv-shelf__counter-divider">/</span>
            <span class="pv-shelf__counter-total" data-counter="216">0</span>
            <span class="pv-shelf__counter-label">productos<br>en pantalla</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="pv-shelf__grid-wrap">
        {% for product in featured_products limit: 8 %}
          {% assign units = product.metafields.custom.bulk_units | default: 0 %}
          {% assign bulk_price = product.metafields.custom.bulk_price | default: 0 %}
          {% assign sku_num = forloop.index | prepend: '00' | slice: -3, 3 %}
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="pv-shelf-card" style="--delay:{{ forloop.index0 | times: 60 }}ms">
            <span class="pv-shelf-card__sku">SKU · {{ sku_num }}</span>
            <div class="pv-shelf-card__img">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img src="{{ product.featured_image | img_url: '400x400' }}" alt="{{ product.title }}" loading="lazy">
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="pv-shelf-card__body">
              {% if product.type and product.type != '' %}<span class="pv-shelf-card__cat">{{ product.type }}</span>{% endif %}
              <h3 class="pv-shelf-card__name">{{ product.title }}</h3>
              {% if units > 0 and bulk_price > 0 %}
                <div class="pv-shelf-card__bulk">
                  <i data-lucide="package"></i>
                  Bulto x<b>{{ units }}</b> · {{ bulk_price | money }} c/u
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="pv-shelf-card__bottom">
              <div class="pv-shelf-card__price-block">
                <span class="pv-shelf-card__price-label">Mayorista</span>
                <span class="pv-shelf-card__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                <span class="pv-shelf-card__price-unit">por unidad</span>
              </div>
              {% if product.available %}
                <span class="pv-shelf-card__add" aria-label="Ver {{ product.title }}">
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
                </span>
              {% else %}
